    <h1 class="msv-hero__title">Living in Andalusia as an Expat: Complete Regional Guide</h1>
    <p class="msv-hero__intro">Andalusia is Spain's largest autonomous community and arguably its most varied — home to Seville, Granada, Málaga, Córdoba, the Costa del Sol, the Sierra Nevada, and the sherry country around Jerez. It's the region most associated internationally with 'authentic Spain'. Here's a comprehensive look at what it's actually like to live here.</p>
  </div>
